title: "haraz-climate-analysis: a reproducible CMIP6 hydroclimatic projection pipeline for the Haraz watershed, northern Iran"
abstract: "Python pipeline for CMIP6 GCM evaluation, LARS-WG 8 / Detrended Quantile Mapping downscaling, EM-based Bayesian Model Averaging, autoregressive BiLSTM streamflow projection, and drought / ETCCDI extreme / compound hot-dry index computation for the Haraz watershed, northern Iran."
